 292+ 03C6              ; Guest RAM backing access
 293+ 03C6              ;
 294+ 03C6              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
 295+ 03C6              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
 296+ 03C6              ; WIN3 is a permanently reserved bank aperture; its current page is volatile.
 297+ 03C6              ; These routines do not restore WIN3's previous page because the page port is
 298+ 03C6              ; write-only and WIN3 is owned exclusively by this memory backend.
 299+ 03C6              ;
 300+ 03C6              ; Entry address: x86_phys_addr = low, middle, high-nibble.
 301+ 03C6              ; Read returns byte in A, carry clear. Non-RAM overlay regions return carry.
 302+ 03C6              ; Write takes byte in A, carry clear on success; non-RAM returns carry.
